OL,3,AMarching bands scramble to cover costs 
OL,4,Aafter Thanksgiving parade rearranged   
OL,6,FTouring musicians from across the US   
OL,7,Fwho descended on New York City to      
OL,8,Fperform at the Macy's Thanksgiving     
OL,9,Fparade have turned to fundraising to   
OL,10,Fcover their costs, after getting stuck 
OL,11,Fwhen the event was rearranged due to a 
OL,12,Fstorm.                                 
OL,14,FA band from Texas told the BBC's US    
OL,15,Fpartner, CBS News, it had raised some  
OL,16,F$350,000 (#267,000) to pay for an      
OL,17,Fextended stay for its 500 members. It  
OL,18,Fsaluted the kindness of its supporters.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
